{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 伤害结算｜流程子图\n当前Player/Boss原Owned hit→共享Builder→GAS结算/Cue；调用方失败响应各归原消费者。\n[[GGYGO_结构_AbilitySystem.canvas|结构图]] · [[GGYGO_流程_战斗链路.canvas|跨模块链]] · [[AbilitySystem/计划_原请求终止|验收边界]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1660,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "window",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. 原Montage Event→GA核Original/原Task/事件来源。\nTryOpenOwnedTraceWindow(Socket/Radius,Expected→Out)→SubscribeWindowHit(原Window,Callback→token)。\nGA闭包捕Original/原窗口/段资源，保存自身token；收尾精确退订/关闭，Legacy兼容入口由Combat说明。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "trace",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. Combat TickComponent→PerformTrace。\n原窗口内跨帧球扫、取PhysicalMaterial、去重→typed hit(原Window,Actor,HitResult)。\n每次原订阅外调后重核窗口，关B开C即退出B旧尾/基线写回；Owned不广播Legacy全局OnMeleeHit。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "effect",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. 原GA命中门禁→选本次GE→BuildHitEffectPayload。\n同次HitResult先AddHitResult再AddOrigin；原Source/Target、Spec扩展及Cue初始化外调后重核。\nCombo显式无GE成功：Context/Cue；Boss要求有效GE。有效必需GE成功：Spec及反馈载荷。\n失败false/空输出，不降级Cue或换GE。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 410,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "execute",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. DamageExecution 捕获源输出和目标承受属性，写 Damage / PoiseDamage 元属性。\n\n物理材质来自 Context；距离取显式 Origin→HitResult.ImpactPoint。没有 HitResult 时距离为 0，不读取 EffectCauser 的当前坐标。",
      "x": 1450,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "health",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. HealthSet 更新生命/韧性；HealthComponent 发变化、破韧或死亡事件。\n\n调用：HealthSet::PreGameplayEffectExecute 免疫/无敌校验 → PostGameplayEffectExecute 清元属性并广播 → HealthComponent::HandleOutOfHealth。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 864,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "cue",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. 成功载荷请求独立碰撞Cue。\n显式无GE直接Cue；有效GE免疫/拒绝仍按原碰撞Cue政策执行。\nHitImpact在K2/Super前Resolve原Context，默认HitResult必需，缺失明确拒绝；正常无Hit须BP显式位置模式。\n已知表面漏配默认拒绝，原点/Overlap合法。\n[[GGYGO_流程_HitImpact.canvas|反馈契约]]",
      "x": 1450,
      "y": 864,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "required-hit-build-failure",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 构造/必需依赖失败出口\n该hit不Apply GE、不Cue，输出与原因明确；Builder不执行能力终止或替代资源。\nCombo→RequestAbilityEnd(固定Original,true,true)，不可取消场景也正式End原动作；Boss只拒绝该hit，保留当前动作。\n原Cleanup/GA早通知/ASC/Completed全退出见[[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|原终止链]]。\n必要Combo运行时故障行为有限验证，真实Error/Fail保留；完整Boss/正式资产/伤害数值/Cue表现/网络仍未验。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 864,
      "width": 850,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "window",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "trace",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "原GA取得Owned Window/token→Combat原窗口Tick"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "trace",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "effect",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "原窗口去重hit→精确订阅闭包核Original"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "effect",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "execute",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "成功非空有效Spec→Apply→GE Execution"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "execute",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "health",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "GE执行元属性→目标Health/Poise结算"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "effect",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "cue",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Builder成功载荷→碰撞Cue；无GE/有效GE免疫拒绝按显式政策"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6-required-hit-build-failure",
      "fromNode": "effect",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "required-hit-build-failure",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "必需依赖/Builder无效→false/空输出，不进入GE/Cue"
    }
  ]
}
